title:
Another bullish start to the week for $NEAR.

@NEARProtocol appears to be emerging as a sweetheart for institutions, @Bitwise's new ETF seeing +$1.4M in net inflows on Monday.

The inflows extend a phenomenal streak for the product which has seen net inflows on all but three days

Zcash gains 7% a day before its 10th birthday

@Zcash's $ZEC rose 7% in the past 24 hours to about $1,307, pushing its market cap to $22.1B. That makes it the ninth-largest crypto, ahead of Hyperliquid and Dogecoin, per CoinMarketCap data.

The move comes as the network counts
